      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Mage-Flow W4A8 + ARA\n\n4-bit Mage-Flow for native ComfyUI quantized kernels, plus an accuracy recovery adapter (ARA): rank 32 in blocks 0-9, rank 64 in blocks 10-11.\n\n**Needs the custom node** [ComfyUI-MageFlow-ARA](https://github.com/kgonia/ComfyUI-MageFlow-ARA).\nA regular LoraLoader merges the ARA into the 4-bit weights and most of the correction is lost.\n\n## Files\n\n**diffusion_models**\n- [mage_flow_w4a8.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/SearchingMan/Mage-Flow-W4A8-ARA/resolve/main/diffusion_models/mage_flow_w4a8.safetensors)\n\n**loras**\n- [mage_flow_w4a8_ara.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/SearchingMan/Mage-Flow-W4A8-ARA/resolve/main/loras/mage_flow_w4a8_ara.safetensors)\n\n**text_encoders**\n- [qwen3vl_4b_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/SearchingMan/Mage-Flow-W4A8-ARA/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_4b_int8_convrot.safetensors) (or Comfy-Org's [qwen3vl_4b_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Mage-Flow/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_4b_bf16.safetensors), 4.3 GB more VRAM)\n\n**vae**\n- [mage_flow_vae_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Mage-Flow/resolve/main/vae/mage_flow_vae_bf16.safetensors)\n\n## Settings\n\n30 steps, CFG 5.0, euler / simple. Width and height: 512-2048, multiples of 16.\nKeep ARA strength at 1.0.\n\nModel card: https://huggingface.co/SearchingMan/Mage-Flow-W4A8-ARA\n"
      ],
      "title": "Read me"
    }
